# Byte caps on the two always loaded files this repo owns, read by
# bin/lint/context-size from the pre-commit hook and from CI. One line per
# file, path|bytes. CLAUDE.md deploys to ~/CLAUDE.md and .claude/CLAUDE.md to
# ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, so both load into every session on the machine. Set
# 2026-08-27 at the first prune (CLAUDE.md went from 35,658 bytes to 11,355)
# with slack for a one line edit; lowering a cap locks a reduction in,
# raising one is a review decision.
CLAUDE.md|12288
.claude/CLAUDE.md|18158
